No arquivo prisma/schema.prisma, dentro do model Student, adicione este campo logo depois de onboardingCompleto:

contractedTrainingDaysPerMonth Int?     @map("contracted_training_days_per_month")

O bloco Student ficará assim:

model Student {
  id                              String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId                          String   @map("user_id")
  name                            String
  email                           String?
  phone                           String?
  notes                           String?
  image                           String?
  active                          Boolean  @default(true)
  userAuthId                      String?  @unique @map("user_auth_id")
  onboardingCompleto              Boolean  @default(false) @map("onboarding_completo")
  contractedTrainingDaysPerMonth  Int?     @map("contracted_training_days_per_month")
  createdAt                       DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt                       DateTime @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  user             User              @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userAuth         User?             @relation("StudentAuth", fields: [userAuthId], references: [id])
  workoutPlans     WorkoutPlan[]
  checkIns         CheckIn[]
  weeklyFeedbacks  WeeklyFeedback[]
  notices          Notice[]
  questions        Question[]
  workouts         Workout[]
  avaliacoes       Avaliacao[]
  noticeReads      NoticeRead[]

  @@map("students")
}
